        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The retired employee and eligible dependents automatically will be enrolled at the time the retired employee becomes eligible, provided the retired employee pays any required contributions. The retired employee and dependents are enrolled in the same plan as immediately before retirement, if applicable.",
