        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Each retired employee with a spouse must provide information regarding coverage available through another employer to determine whether special contributions are required to enroll the spouse. If the retired employee does not authorize a required contribution, the spouse will not be enrolled for medical coverage. The retired employee will not be able to enroll the spouse until the date the spouse loses the option to be covered under the other employer-sponsored medical plan.",
